{\fontsize{30}{36}\selectfont\bfseries\color{ChapterStone}\kaiti\selectfont 我必甘心愛他們}\\[0.10cm]
{\fontsize{16}{20}\selectfont\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} I Will Love Them Freely}

