{\footnotesize\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} “nedavah”}\quad
{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{AlmondRose!80!black} 白白地、甘心 \textperiodcentered\ 何 14:4}

\vfill

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{AlmondRose!70!black}\kaiti\selectfont
「我必醫治他們背道的病，甘心愛他們；因為我的怒氣向他們轉消。」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“I will heal their apostasy, I will love them freely, for My anger has turned away from them.”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{ChapterStone} 何西阿書 14:4 \textperiodcentered\ Hosea 14:4}
