\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
以法蓮哪，我怎能捨棄你？以色列啊，我怎能棄絕你？……\textbf{\color{AshClay!80!black}我回心轉意，我的憐愛大大發動。}\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
How can I give you up, O Ephraim? How can I surrender you, O Israel? \ldots\ \textbf{My heart is turned over within Me, all My compassions are kindled.}\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterStone} 何西阿書 11:8 \textperiodcentered\ Hosea 11:8
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 十四章經文 \textperiodcentered\ 十五篇研讀 \textperiodcentered\ 四卷 \textperiodcentered\ 神先動手、贖價先付；神的心腸先翻轉\\
\textit{Fourteen chapters of Hosea in fifteen studies \textperiodcentered\ four volumes \textperiodcentered\ God moves first and pays first; the heart turns over in God before it turns in the people}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.5cm}p{1.9cm}p{6.7cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷} & \textbf{研讀篇} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一：婚姻即信息 & 1-4篇 & 神先動手、贖價先付；孩子的名字先宣告、同一章就翻轉 \\
卷二：訴訟與退隱 & 5-7篇 & 先爭辯、後審判；神退回原處，等人來尋 \\
卷三：醫治與顯露 & 8-11篇 & 神一伸手要醫，病就顯露；人卻向別處求救 \\
卷四：心腸翻轉與白白的愛 & 12-15篇 & 神的心先翻轉；贖脫陰間；神自己醫治、甘心愛 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一部亡國的預言，是來看神怎樣先開口、先付價、先退隱、先心腸翻轉。\\
人說「來吧，我們歸向耶和華」，神說他們的良善如早晨的雲霧；書卻以神自己動手醫治作結，最後一句留給讀者。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
Not a chronicle of doom: God speaks first, pays first, withdraws first, and is moved first. Israel's
`come, let us return' meets the answer that their loyalty is a morning mist; yet the book ends with God's own healing, and its last line is left to the reader.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
